    "description": "Both inner layers are ground. The board draws about 200 mA, which the 0.6 mm supply tracks carry comfortably, so an unbroken reference plane under every outer trace is worth more here than a power plane - and no PDM clock or data line can cross a plane split. This entry used to say the second inner layer carried +3V3A, which the board has never done.",
